# Review ownership.
#
# The point of this file is not bureaucracy — it is that the paths where a mistake
# is expensive should never merge without the person who can spot the mistake. A
# later contributor inherits the map instead of having to know it.
#
# Last matching pattern wins, so the specific entries are at the bottom.

# Default owner for everything not claimed below.
*                               @konradcinkusz

